title: Rebuild the Red Map
subtitle: Warsaw visibility cannot nominate councillors or reopen a county office.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: poland_party_card
view-if: month_actions < max_month_actions and poland_local_structures_timer <= 0 and (local_network < 70 or organiser_energy < 50 or turnout_readiness < 55 or early_election_risk >= 30)
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; poland_local_structures_timer = 4
card-image: img/poland/cards/local-structures.webp

= Rebuild the Red Map

Outside the largest cities the alliance is often an old SLD address, a Razem
group chat and a Wiosna volunteer who no longer answers the phone. Regional
leaders submit three mutually incompatible plans for rebuilding it.

- @county_offices
- @shared_grants
- @candidate_desks

@county_offices
title: Reopen the county offices
subtitle: Cost: 2 resources. The strongest structure, under old-guard supervision.
choose-if: resources >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: Reopening offices requires two resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 2; local_network += 8; organiser_energy += 3; left_poll += 0.2; barons_strength += 2; barons_dissent -= 3; razem_dissent += 2; rural_support += 3; pensioner_support += 1; turnout_readiness += 2; primary_machine_slate = 1; news_headline = "County offices return to the political map"

Former councillors find rooms, printers and lists of members who still answer.
It works. Younger partners ask why every key happens to be held by an SLD
veteran.

- #poland_card_finish

@shared_grants
title: Split local grants between parties and movements
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Less control, more organisers willing to stay.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Even small local grants require one resource.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; local_network += 5; organiser_energy += 5; movement_autonomy += 4; progressives_dissent -= 2; razem_dissent -= 3; barons_dissent += 4; party_unity += 1; young_support += 2; women_support += 1; turnout_readiness += 2; movement_primary_opened = 1; primary_movement_slate = 1; news_headline = "Local grants create allies headquarters cannot command"

Tenant groups, feminist collectives and party branches share the money. They
also retain their names and the right to criticise headquarters. That is the
price of recruiting people rather than renting an audience.

- #poland_card_finish

@candidate_desks
title: Build volunteer candidate desks
subtitle: Free and practical, but substitutes a campaign operation for a durable party.
on-arrival: local_network += 3; public_trust += 1; organiser_energy += 2; barons_dissent -= 1; movement_autonomy -= 3; turnout_readiness += 3; primary_signature_network = 1; news_headline = "Volunteer desks begin searching for local candidates"

A narrow operation vets candidates and answers councillors' questions. It will
help at the next election, though much of it may disappear when the campaign
does.

- #poland_card_finish
